This directory is a vendored fork of the incremental-dataflow package from
TanStack DB (https://github.com/TanStack/db), which is itself derived from
@electric-sql/d2ts (https://github.com/electric-sql/d2ts). It is redistributed
here under the MIT licence it was published under, reproduced below.

The fork is not a copy. The time/version machinery is removed, `iterate` is
queue-driven rather than time-stepped, and `recursiveDistinct`, `stringDistinct`
and `minByKey` are additions. `override` modifiers were added in four places so
the code type-checks under the engine's compiler settings, which are stricter
than the ones it was written against; that change is annotation only.

